==History==
2016
*The Ice Spirit [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/7/2016, in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], changed the walking animation of the Ice Spirit.
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], decreased the Ice Spirit's freeze duration to 1.5 seconds (from 2 seconds).
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Ice Spirit's damage by 10%.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], decreased the Ice Spirit's damage by 4% and freeze duration to 1 second (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], made it so that the Ice Spirit can no longer reset the attack of the [[Zappies]].
2020
*On 3/2/2020, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/2/2020)|February 2020 Update]], added a card render to the Ice Spirit's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], increased the Ice Spirit's freeze duration to 1.3 seconds (from 1 second).
2023
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Ice Spirit's freeze duration to 1.2 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 4/12/2023, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/12/2023)|December 2023 Update]], added the Ice Spirit's Evolution.
2025
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Ice Spirit's freeze duration to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Ice Spirit's hitpoints by 6%

