==Trivia==
*The Ice Spirit, along with [[Skeletons]], [[Electro Spirit]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Warmth]], [[Heal Spirit]], and [[Heal]], are the cheapest [[cards]], costing 1 [[Elixir]].
*The Ice Spirit is 1 of 7 cards associated with ice, with the others being [[Giant Snowball]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Freeze]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Super Ice Golem]], and [[Wizard Trio]].
**In the French, Italian, Portuguese, Malaysian, and Finnish language settings of the game, the Ice Spirit's name translates to "Spirit of Ice". In the Persian language settings of the game, the Ice Spirit's name translates to "Ice Soul".
**A Trainer in the [[Training Camp]] is called Trainer Freeze and uses 4 ice-related cards in their [[Battle Decks|deck]], one of them being Ice Spirit, and the others being Giant Snowball, Ice Golem, and Freeze.
*The Ice Spirit is 1 of 8 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] to die as part of its attack, the others being the Electro Spirit, Fire Spirit, [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Battle Ram]], Heal Spirit, [[Suspicious Bush]], and [[Wall Breakers]].
*The Ice Spirit is 1 of 9 troops that have the same sprite for both players, the others are Skeletons, Electro Spirit, Fire Spirit, [[Bats]], Heal Spirit, [[Elixir Golem|Elixir Blob]], [[Phoenix]], and [[Lava Hound|Lava Pup]].
*Out of the four Spirit cards, it is the only one with no pupils.
*The Ice Spirit, along with the [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Barbarians]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Musketeer]], [[Giant]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[Prince]], and [[Night Witch]], is featured as a sticker in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IMessage iMessage], in a sticker pack called [https://apps.apple.com/us/app/clash-theater-stickers/id1353823484 Clash Theater].
*The Ice Spirit’s gender is confirmed to be male, as in the balance changes in the [[Version History#April 2022 Update (4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]] it states, "''We want to provide more distinct use for the Ice Spirit compared to his counterparts the Electro Spirit.''"
*The Ice Spirit's description references that of Clash of Clans' Freeze spell, which is, "''When the going gets hot, stay frosty!''"
**In the Spanish language setting of the game, the Ice Spirit's card description says "''Winter is coming''", which is a reference to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_of_Thrones Game of Thrones], more specifically, the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winter_Is_Coming first episode of the series].
*In [[Touchdown]], if an Ice Spirit jumps into the enemy end zone as it attacks, it does not count as a point. This is because a jumping spirit no longer counts as a troop; it becomes similar to a projectile.
*In the Ice Spirit's concept art, it is referred to as "Snow Spirit".
*The Ice Spirit, along with the [[Minions]], [[Bomber]], Skeletons, [[Skeleton Dragons]], Mini P.E.K.K.A, [[Mega Minion]], Ice Golem, [[Dart Goblin]], Elixir Golem, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], [[Guards]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Golem]], Wall Breakers, [[Bowler]], [[Executioner]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Royal Ghost]], and Lava Hound, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
**It is the 1 of 2 troops that appears in a modifier in Squad Busters, the other being Royal Ghost.
**Unlike the other monsters, the Ice Spirit does not attack the player, instead being completely passive.
*The Ice Spirit is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Ice Spirit is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
**The Ice Spirit is the subject of a few [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]] items.
***The Ice Spirit decoration is identical to its card render.
***The Goblin Drummer decoration is created by Myoho.
*The Ice Spirit was featured in the winning decks of multiple Clash Royale Tournaments. More specifically:
**The Ice Spirit was featured in the winning deck of the [https://youtu.be/LWQjS0e6iiE Super Magical Cup Tournament], by a player called CMcHugh.
**The Ice Spirit was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/psZXKWHkKkE?si=PbjvbZt8stghz6eJ King's Cup II Tournament], by a player called Surgical Goblin.
**The Ice Spirit was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/C5qBcdcErfM?si=e37mhAgNKAA5kMJI Clash Royale League 2018 Tournament], by a player called Lciop.
*Despite its [[Card Mastery]] task being "Speed Limit", the Ice Spirit does not slow down enemies, instead it stuns them.

